<div class="about-page">

  <section class="about-story section-padding">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-story__inner">
        <p class="about-eyebrow">About Brightfield</p>
        <h1 class="about-story__heading">Hi, I'm Eric.</h1>
        <div class="about-story__body">
          <p>I make wearable art from shader code.</p>
          <p>Brightfield began when I started experimenting with WebGL fragment shaders and kept discovering visuals that felt too interesting to stay on a screen. I wanted to turn that process into something people could actually wear.</p>

          <p id="how-it-works">Every design here starts as a real shader program — not stock art, not a preset, not a filtered graphic. Designs are ready to go just as they are, but I invite you to jump in, tweak the settings, and make them your own. You can customize the parameters, generate a preview, and create something that feels personal, playful, and unexpected.</p>

          <p>You don’t need to know anything about shaders or code to design your own shirt. You just need to be curious! ✨</p>

<p style="padding-top: 20px;">For information about printing, shipping, returns, etc, see our <a class="about-inline-link" href="/pages/faq">Frequently Asked Questions page</a>.</p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .about-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  /* Story */
  .about-story__inner {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .about-story__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .about-story__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-story__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-inline-link {
  color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About",
  "presets": [
    { "name": "About" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
